        "collapsible_tab_ptCdTk": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sizing",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Measure the chest at the widest part of the ribcage, just behind the front legs. Snug, not tight.</p><p>Between sizes, or a thick double coat? Go up. Staffies and bulldogs: pick by chest, then tighten the belly strap fully.</p><p>Full chart, breed examples and fitting steps in the <a href=\"/pages/size-guide\">Size Guide</a> and <a href=\"/pages/fitting-guide\">Fitting Guide</a>. Wrong size? Free swap within 60 days.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "show_product_description": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_EBKNVc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Free standard shipping Australia-wide on every harness order (Australia Post, tracked). Express Post A$9.95. We ship within one business day.</p><p>60-Day Loose-Lead Guarantee: if it hasn't changed your walks, email us within 60 days. We send a prepaid Australia Post return label and refund you in full once it's scanned in. Size swaps are free.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/shipping-returns\">Shipping &amp; returns</a> · <a href=\"/pages/guarantee\">The guarantee</a></p>",
            "page": "",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "show_product_description": false
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "collapsible_tab_does": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What it does — and what it doesn't",
            "content": "<p>It gives you more control by redirecting your dog's forward momentum. It doesn't replace loose-lead training — it makes that training easier to practise safely.</p><p><strong>What it does:</strong> redirects forward pulling, gives you greater control, reduces pressure on the neck, supports loose-lead practice.</p><p><strong>What it doesn't:</strong> train your dog automatically, replace supervision, or resist unsupervised chewing.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/first-10-walks\">Read the first 10 walks</a>.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "show_product_description": false
          }
        },
